    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR3j0010-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-09T00:36:37.503+09:00">【【章旨】 這一章說〈氾論〉用很細密的方法推導事物的樸素之本，預見事物的得失變化和利病間的正反關係, 目的是使人不受到「勢利」、「事態」的誘惑，而能持身有則、考察時勢之變、隨著事物的變化而轉變。】〈氾論〉這一篇，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-09T00:36:49.059+09:00">就像用針線縫合綃衣的縫隙、</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-09T00:37:34.532+09:00">用小木籤塞進牙齒空隙</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-09T00:48:10.347+09:00">那様立論嚴密，速接路徑而使斜為直，  【施：斜；不正。CH: this is not among the many meanings in HYDCD.】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-09T00:39:37.451+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-09T00:40:20.421+09:00">和預見事情得失的變化</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-09T00:40:27.052+09:00">和利病之間的正反關係，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-09T00:41:14.637+09:00">為的是使人不要妄自沉沒於勢利之中、</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-09T00:41:21.76+09:00">不要受到事物表面形態的誘惑，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-09T00:41:33.538+09:00">做人行事如日行軌道，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-09T00:41:39.491+09:00">同時還能考察時勢的變化，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-09T00:42:49.245+09:00">而随著事物的變化一起轉變。</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
